  <VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.jobString>正在制作魔鬼素粉</VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.jobString>
  <!--EN: make luciferium powder-->
  <VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.label>制作魔鬼素粉</VBE_MakeLuciferiumPowder.label>
  <!--EN: Make soda syrup by mixing natural fruit juice with sugar. This recipe is much more efficient.-->
  <VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.description>用天然果汁和蔗糖来制作糖浆。效率比果糖更高。</VBE_MakeSodaSyrupBulk.description>
